C. industry  
D. trade  

---

**Q47.** Trade between countries is called:

A. barter trade  
B. local trade  
C. international trade  
D. internal trade  

---

**Q48.** The capital city of Cameroon is:

A. Bamenda  
B. Buea  
C. Douala  
D. Yaoundé  

---

**Q49.** The largest city and main port of Cameroon is:

